{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and collect <strong>Pondlings</strong> from unique, ambient fishing zones, with hundreds of exciting;<strong>\u00a0</strong>pattern, colour, and personality combinations to collect, name and care for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a <strong>Pondling-Tank</strong> that is truly <u>your own</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Catch</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong>Pondlings in a variety of <i>Unique</i>, and <i>Ambient</i> Locations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/08ab7fc95858ca804196bc9b1075bafa.poster.avif?t=1758803799\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/08ab7fc95858ca804196bc9b1075bafa.webm?t=1758803799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Collect</strong></u> Pondlings of hundreds of possible colour and personality combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/b01bae39e603b9be0bb69e17608545e7.poster.avif?t=1758803799\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639710/extras/b01bae39e603b9be0bb69e17608545e7.webm?t=1758803799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Decorate</u></strong> your tank with a variety of\u00a0<strong>backgrounds</strong>, <strong>flooring</strong> and <strong>decoration</strong> objects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\